{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:45:46+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T06:45:46+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Assicurazioni Generali S.p.A.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Diversified","country":"Italy","city":"Trieste","website":"https://www.generali.com","employees":88255,"summary":"Assicurazioni Generali S.p.A. provides various insurance solutions under the Generali brand in the Americas, Italy, rest of Europe, Africa, the Middle East, Asia, and the Oceania. The company operates through Life, Property & Casualty, and Asset & Wealth Management segments. It offers savings, individual and family protection, and unit linked products, as well as motor third-party liability, home, property and casualty, accident, health, and commercial and industrial risks insurance products; and insurance plans for multinational companies. It also provides equity and fixed-income funds, and alternative products. The company was formerly known as Assicurazioni Generali Austro-Italiche and changed its name to Assicurazioni Generali S.p.A. in 1848. Assicurazioni Generali S.p.A. was founded in 1831 and is headquartered in Trieste, Italy.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Assicurazioni Generali S.p.A. fournit diverses solutions d'assurance sous la marque Generali en Amérique, en Italie, dans le reste de l'Europe, en Afrique, au Moyen-Orient, en Asie et en Océanie. La société opère à travers les secteurs de la vie, de l'immobilier et des pertes, et de la gestion d'actifs et de patrimoine. Il offre des produits d'épargne, de protection individuelle et familiale, ainsi que des produits d'assurance responsabilité civile automobile, habitation, propriété et accident, santé et risques commerciaux et industriels; et des plans d'assurance pour les entreprises multinationales."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":645048